Retained server plans
=====================

SERVER_CARVE_OUT_PLAN.md defines the approved cut. Individual files here retain
contracts for the eight Scala tools, ML declarations/parameters/activation,
root catalogue and target resolution, session setup, readiness, generic bridge,
connection lifecycle and verification tooling.

Obsolete feature plans and their claims were deleted, not marked verified.
ASSUMPTIONS is generated from current files with:

    tools/planning-gate registry generate

Test metadata links retained claims to meaningful checks. Static coverage only
states intended coverage; tools/planning-gate done supplies executed acceptance
at a stable revision. A historical status or inherited baseline is not evidence
that this carve-out passed. Preserve required runtime layers and report genuine
environment blockers separately.
